#. 朝日奈さん、ここにいたんだね。
#. ちょっと聞きたい事があるんだけどさ…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So this is where you've been hiding. Listen, I was\n"
"hoping to talk to you..."
msgstr ""

#. な、苗木…！？
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "M-Makoto!?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. わ、私！　急いでるからッ！！
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "S-Sorry! Gotta go!"
msgstr ""

#. …え！？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "Cái gì...?"

#. <CLT 4>呼び止めるヒマもなく、
#. 朝日奈さんは、猛スピードで走り去ってしまった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She ran off so fast, I didn't even have time to ask\n"
"her to stop.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さん……
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hina..."
msgstr "Hina..."

#. <CLT 4>どうして…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Tại sao...?"

#. <CLT 4>どうして…ボクを避けるみたいに…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why won't you talk to me?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. こんな物に構ってられるかッ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I\n"
"can't waste my time with this...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. こんな物に構ってる場合じゃない！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to waste staring into this stupid\n"
"surveillance camera...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時は金なり。
#. つまり、貯金を使い果たしていくのが人生。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Time is money, they say. Which means the more money\n"
"you spend, the sooner you die...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0013 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
